    "body": "Correction to the body: I read the assertion sides backwards. **Main's output is the safe one.** The post rapids to the safe plane (Z1.9685 = 50 mm) and descends with a protected `G38.3` feed to Z0.9843, as #570 requires. The **stale goldens** from #583 held the pre-#570 rapid straight down to Z0.9843 (25 mm). So this is still a stale-golden test break and not a safety regression, with the direction the other way round. I checked all six regenerated files: no `G0` runs below the safe plane.",
